OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Never, ever forget' - America marks
OL,4,A25th anniversary of 9/11 attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoments of silence were held to mark
OL,7,Fthe timings of the attacks and the
OL,8,Fnames of nearly 3,000 people who died
OL,9,Fwere read out.
OL,11,FTwo beams of light illuminated the
OL,12,FManhattan sky for a Tribute in Light on
OL,13,FFriday evening, as other landmarks in
OL,14,Fthe state lit up in blue in
OL,15,Fcommemoration.
